=======================

Ported design and API surface
-----------------------------

This library is a re-implementation, on plain android.view.View and Drawable, of the public API
surface and the visual behaviour of Jetpack Wear Compose:

    androidx.wear.compose.material3
    androidx.wear.compose.foundation
    androidx.wear.compose.material
    androidx.wear.compose.materialcore

    Copyright The Android Open Source Project
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
    Source: https://github.com/androidx/androidx (androidx-wear-compose)

Attribution is given under the terms of Apache-2.0 sections 4(a) and 4(b). Source files in this
library carry no per-file header on purpose: the re-implementations are Hibari's own code, and where
a file is a translation of an upstream file, the file's own documentation names the upstream file and
the line ranges it was read from.

Copied resources
----------------

These files are verbatim or near-verbatim copies from androidx.wear.compose and stay under Apache-2.0:

    src/main/res/drawable/wear_m3c_check_animation.xml
    src/main/res/drawable/wear_m3c_failure_animation.xml
    src/main/res/drawable/wear_m3c_error.xml
    src/main/res/drawable/wear_m3c_open_on_phone_animation.xml
    src/main/res/values/strings.xml      (keys and default English values)
    Numeric token values under src/main/java/com/huanli233/hibari/wear/tokens/

